 "about": "Kimetsu no Yaiba / Demon Slayer (Infinity Castle movie 1). CR (Erai-raws) gives movie signs as plain top-centre Arial lines. Original signs are kanji drawn on things: 滅/殺/素流 on uniforms and haori, 悪鬼滅殺 engraved on blades, 上弦/壱..陸 in demons' eyes, brush ink on Ubuyashiki maps and wooden boards / scrolls, the movie logo. Masks only where the kanji sit on a static or rigidly moving surface (signboard, hanging scroll, oval on a map); on clothes, blades and eyes the Russian text goes next to the kanji in brush (Edo SZ HQ: all-caps brush, readable; Kashima reads worse) coloured like the kanji: sign_red (sword 滅), sign_blue / sign_white (blade engravings), sign_gold (eyes of Upper Moons), sign_green (Kaigaku), sign_pink (Nakime), sign_ice (Akaza's compass needle), paper (black ink on a cream edge: haori paper squares, a man's back), ink (black ink with a soft paper glow: maps, boards, scrolls), title_red / title_white (under the logo, three lines: series name white em 32, arc red em 64, part white em 44; the logo itself stays). Masks: hanging scroll / signboard / oval on a map use `inside` + `fill: true` (surface fill of the whole paper / board). Songs: Cormorant Garamond Bold italic, pale gold, dark burgundy edge, soft dark glow; moved left of the credit roll at the end. PlayRes 640x360.",
